WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.868
-Thank you very much, everyone.
Thank you, thank you.

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:06.039
Welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:07.907
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:11.277
That's what I'm talking about.

00:00:11.277 --> 00:00:13.747
Well, guys, today is March 11th,

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:16.682
and that marks a pretty big
anniversary around the world.

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:19.218
-One year ago today --
-Exactly one year ago.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:20.452
-It's been a year.
-One year.

00:00:20.452 --> 00:00:22.622
-It's been one year.
-The nation marks one year

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:23.823
since it's been on lockdown

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:26.359
because of
the coronavirus pandemic.

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:30.329
-Yeah, the past year was just
like flying United Airlines.

00:00:30.329 --> 00:00:32.565
The engine fell off,
but somehow we still made it.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:34.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.734 --> 00:00:35.968
Yeah, it was a year ago today

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:39.072
that we had our last show
with a full audience.

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:41.240
Six days later,
I did the show from home,

00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:44.143
and six days after that,
both my kids had agents.

00:00:44.143 --> 00:00:48.581
[ Laughter ]

00:00:48.581 --> 00:00:51.584
That's right. It's been a year
living through the pandemic,

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.352
and to mark the occasion,
President Biden

00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:56.856 line:0%
delivered his first prime-time
address to the nation.

00:00:56.856 --> 00:00:59.893
The media has been calling Biden
the "healer-in-chief,"

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.927
and he's really
embracing the role.

00:01:01.927 --> 00:01:04.631
The only thing he can't "heel"
is a German Shepherd

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:06.266
sprinting at
a Secret Service agent.

00:01:06.266 --> 00:01:09.135
"Heel boy! Heel!"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:11.437
"Don't worry about it.
He'll tire himself out."

00:01:11.437 --> 00:01:13.306
[ Laughter ]

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:16.075
Honestly, it was just nice
to see a presidential speech

00:01:16.075 --> 00:01:19.345
where the teleprompter didn't
say, "Ad-lib insane conspiracy."

00:01:19.345 --> 00:01:20.746
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.746 --> 00:01:24.116
Meanwhile, I saw there's
a new PSA calling on Americans

00:01:24.116 --> 00:01:26.051
to get vaccinated,
and it features

00:01:26.051 --> 00:01:29.088
all the living former
presidents, except for Trump.

00:01:29.088 --> 00:01:30.222
Watch this.

00:01:30.222 --> 00:01:31.991
-This vaccine means hope.

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:36.896
-We've lost enough people and
we've suffered enough damage.

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:40.533
-Important for our fellow
citizens to get vaccinated.

00:01:40.533 --> 00:01:42.268
-Now it's up to you.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.338
-Americans were like,
"Wow, no Trump,"

00:01:46.338 --> 00:01:48.675
while Trump was like,
"Wow, no Martin Sheen."

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:53.712
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.712 --> 00:01:56.916
Yeah, it feels like Trump's
gonna always be the one diva

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:58.918
cast member who won't come back
for the reunion.

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:00.720
You know them?
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.555
Instead of participating
in the PSA,

00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:04.591
Trump released this statement.

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:07.794
-"I hope everyone remembers when
they're getting the COVID-19,

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:10.129
often referred to as
the China virus, vaccine,

00:02:10.129 --> 00:02:11.530
that if I wasn't president,

00:02:11.530 --> 00:02:13.031
you wouldn't be getting
that beautiful shot

00:02:13.031 --> 00:02:14.500
for five years at best

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:16.102
and probably wouldn't be
getting it at all.

00:02:16.102 --> 00:02:20.306
I hope everyone remembers."

00:02:20.306 --> 00:02:21.874
-Can't stop, won't stop.

00:02:21.874 --> 00:02:24.644
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:28.180
I do want to remind him though
that for us to remember you,

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:31.717
you have to go away.

00:02:31.717 --> 00:02:34.954
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.954 --> 00:02:36.956
It's the first step.

00:02:36.956 --> 00:02:39.324
Well, guys, baseball season
is right around the corner,

00:02:39.324 --> 00:02:40.426
and one team just made

00:02:40.426 --> 00:02:42.328
a pretty big announcement.
Watch this.

00:02:42.328 --> 00:02:45.564
-The Texas Rangers will be the
first major professional team

00:02:45.564 --> 00:02:48.267
in the U.S. to allow
full-capacity crowds

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.002
since the pandemic began.

00:02:50.002 --> 00:02:53.139
The team says that it will allow
just over 40,000 fans

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:56.476
at its April 5th home opener
at Globe Life Field.

00:02:58.177 --> 00:02:59.979
-Well, that should be fun.

00:02:59.979 --> 00:03:02.815
"Everyone, please rise,
cough on each other

00:03:02.815 --> 00:03:05.084
and join us in
creating the fourth wave."

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:06.853
[ Laughter ]

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:09.388
I don't know if we're
quite ready for an event

00:03:09.388 --> 00:03:12.057
where an entire row of people
passes $10 one way,

00:03:12.057 --> 00:03:14.160
then a beer the other way.

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.962
The players are like, "Well,
we're not coming, but have fun.

00:03:16.962 --> 00:03:19.532
I mean, you guys,
that sounds great."

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:23.435
Yeah, Rangers fans are excited
to be at a packed ballpark

00:03:23.435 --> 00:03:25.437
where they can catch
a foul ball, a home run,

00:03:25.437 --> 00:03:27.640
or the South African
COVID variant.

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:29.208
[ Laughter ]

00:03:29.208 --> 00:03:31.477
Here's an update on a big story.

00:03:31.477 --> 00:03:34.179
Four days after Prince Harry
and Meghan Markle's interview,

00:03:34.179 --> 00:03:36.683
Prince William made
his first comment to the press.

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:37.817
Watch this.

00:03:49.661 --> 00:03:52.431
After hearing that, for
the very first time in her life,

00:03:52.431 --> 00:03:54.300
the Queen said, "Oy."

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.702
[ Laughter ]

00:03:56.702 --> 00:03:58.971
Meanwhile, a 7-year-old
on a swing was like,

00:03:58.971 --> 00:04:00.873
"Better off saying
'no comment.'"

00:04:00.873 --> 00:04:03.075
[ Laughter ]

00:04:03.075 --> 00:04:05.044
I'm not saying Prince William
was desperate,

00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:07.647
but eventually he yelled,
"Is that Piers Morgan?" and ran.

00:04:07.647 --> 00:04:09.115
[ Laughter ]

00:04:09.115 --> 00:04:10.983
And finally, last night
was the season premiere

00:04:10.983 --> 00:04:12.451
of "The Masked Singer,"

00:04:12.451 --> 00:04:16.021
and the snail turned out to be
someone you might not expect.

00:04:16.021 --> 00:04:17.089
Check it out.

00:04:17.089 --> 00:04:18.991
-Take it off! Take it off!

00:04:18.991 --> 00:04:20.326
-Who is it?

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:22.929
-Uh-oh.
-Oh, my gosh!

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:25.031
-What?

00:04:25.031 --> 00:04:26.532
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:26.532 --> 00:04:29.768
[ Laughter ]

00:04:29.768 --> 00:04:32.638
-What the hell?

00:04:32.638 --> 00:04:35.507
-After that, millions of people
watching at home were like,

00:04:35.507 --> 00:04:36.875
"What am I doing with my life?"

00:04:36.875 --> 00:04:39.345
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:43.616
"A fake frog come out
of a fake snail.

00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:45.284
I'm 58 years old."

00:04:45.284 --> 00:04:47.220
[ Laughter ]
"What am I doing?"

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.222
[ Laughter ]

00:04:50.222 --> 00:04:52.158
Yeah, appearing on
"The Masked Singer"

00:04:52.158 --> 00:04:54.427
is another way of saying,
"I hope everyone remembers me."

